rs and comedians. Launched in 2017\, SUP is marketed as ?a podcast for geni
 
uses.? It?s irreverent\, internet-literate\, and unafraid to find the absur
 
dity in the culture we?re all living through. No one covers Bravo the way S
 
UP does. Listeners describe it as eavesdropping on two of their funniest fr
 
iends. There?s intimacy! There?s inside jokes! There?s shared vocabulary! F
 
or one night in Charleston\, the most obsessive Bravo superfans in the coun
 
